<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>SoundWave — 회원가입</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/variables.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/base.css">
  <style>
    body { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
           min-height:100vh; background:var(--bg-base); }
    .auth-wrap { width:100%; max-width:400px; padding:24px; }
    .auth-logo  { text-align:center; margin-bottom:28px; }
    .auth-logo-icon {
      width:56px; height:56px; background:var(--accent); border-radius:50%;
      display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin:0 auto 12px;
    }
    .auth-logo-text { font-size:22px; font-weight:900; }
    .auth-card {
      background:var(--bg-surface); border-radius:var(--radius-xl);
      padding:32px 28px;
      box-shadow:0 24px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.5), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.07);
    }
    .auth-title    { font-size:22px; font-weight:900; margin-bottom:4px; }
    .auth-subtitle { font-size:13px; color:var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom:24px; }
    .form-group    { margin-bottom:14px; }
    .form-group label { display:block; font-size:12px; font-weight:700;
                        color:var(--text-secondary); text-transform:uppercase;
                        letter-spacing:1px; margin-bottom:6px; }
    .form-group input {
      width:100%; background:var(--bg-mid); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
      border-radius:var(--radius-md); padding:12px 14px; font-size:14px;
      color:var(--text-base); font-family:var(--font); outline:none;
      transition:border-color var(--transition-fast), box-shadow var(--transition-fast);
    }
    .form-group input:focus {
      border-color:var(--accent); box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(30,215,96,.15);
    }
    .auth-btn {
      width:100%; background:var(--accent); border:none; color:#000;
      padding:13px; border-radius:var(--radius-full); font-size:13px;
      font-weight:700; cursor:pointer; font-family:var(--font);
      text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:1.4px; margin-top:8px;
      transition:background var(--transition-fast), transform var(--transition-fast);
    }
    .auth-btn:hover { background:#1bc451; transform:scale(1.01); }
    .auth-msg-error {
      background:rgba(243,114,127,.1); border:1px solid rgba(243,114,127,.3);
      border-radius:var(--radius-md); padding:10px 14px; font-size:13px;
      color:var(--negative); margin-bottom:16px;
    }
    .auth-footer { text-align:center; margin-top:20px; font-size:13px;
                   color:var(--text-secondary); }
    .auth-footer a { color:var(--accent); text-decoration:none; }
    .socials { display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-bottom:18px }
    .social-btn { display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;
                  border-radius:var(--radius-full);padding:11px;font-size:13px;
                  font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;font-family:var(--font) }
    .social-btn.google { background:#fff;color:#1a1a1a;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.1) }
    .social-btn.naver  { background:#03C75A;color:#fff;border:none }
    .divider { display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:18px 0;
               font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted) }
    .divider::before, .divider::after { content:'';flex:1;height:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1) }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="auth-wrap">
  <div class="auth-logo">
    <div class="auth-logo-icon">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="#000" width="26" height="26">
        <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="13" fill="none" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2.5"/>
        <path d="M12.5 10.5v11l9-5.5-9-5.5z"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="auth-logo-text">SoundWave</div>
  </div>

  <div class="auth-card">
    <div class="auth-title">SoundWave 시작하기</div>
    <div class="auth-subtitle">무료 계정을 만들어보세요</div>

    {{#errorMsg}}
    <div class="auth-msg-error">{{errorMsg}}</div>
    {{/errorMsg}}

    <div class="socials">
      <a href="/api/oauth/google" class="social-btn google">
        <span style="font-weight:900;color:#4285F4">G</span> Google로 계속하기
      </a>
      <a href="/api/oauth/naver" class="social-btn naver">
        <span style="font-weight:900">N</span> 네이버로 계속하기
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="divider">또는 이메일로 가입</div>

    <form action="/signup" method="post">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="email">이메일</label>
        <input type="email" id="email" name="email"
               placeholder="이메일 주소" required autocomplete="email">
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="username">사용자명</label>
        <input type="text" id="username" name="username"
               placeholder="사용자명 (영문, 숫자)" required>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="displayName">이름</label>
        <input type="text" id="displayName" name="displayName"
               placeholder="표시될 이름">
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="password">비밀번호</label>
        <input type="password" id="password" name="password"
               placeholder="8자 이상 입력" required minlength="8">
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="auth-btn">계정 만들기</button>
    </form>
  </div>

  <div class="auth-footer">
    이미 계정이 있으신가요? <a href="/login">로그인</a>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
